WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.666
At home Rabbit was excited.

2
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:10.693
"Henry said I'm real!" he told everyone.

3
00:00:10.694 --> 00:00:16.854
Horse and the dinosaurs cheered.

4
00:00:16.855 --> 00:00:19.357
But Robot sneered.

5
00:00:19.358 --> 00:00:22.304
"Oh yeah?" Robot said.

6
00:00:22.305 --> 00:00:27.057
"Then where are your feet and legs?"

7
00:00:27.058 --> 00:00:29.317
Rabbit frowned.

8
00:00:29.318 --> 00:00:42.464
"Can't you ever be nice, Robot?"

9
00:00:42.465 --> 00:00:45.064
Rabbit tried to stay happy.

10
00:00:45.065 --> 00:00:48.387
But he couldn't forget what Robot said.

11
00:00:48.388 --> 00:00:51.210
"He's right," Rabbit thought.

12
00:00:51.211 --> 00:00:54.411
Rabbit had no feet or legs.

13
00:00:54.412 --> 00:00:56.732
So how could he be real?

14
00:00:56.733 --> 00:01:00.964
"I am real," he told himself firmly.

15
00:01:00.965 --> 00:01:04.668
"And someday I will hop and jump."

16
00:01:04.669 --> 00:01:06.672
Rabbit kept practicing.

17
00:01:06.673 --> 00:01:10.972
He used all his strength.

18
00:01:10.973 --> 00:01:19.945
But all he could do was flip over.

19
00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:22.650
One day Robot was watching Rabbit.

20
00:01:22.651 --> 00:01:25.583
"Ha-ha!" Robot said.

21
00:01:25.584 --> 00:01:29.970
"See—you're only a toy!"

22
00:01:29.971 --> 00:01:32.578
Rabbit didn't say anything.

23
00:01:32.579 --> 00:01:36.561
He just looked away.

24
00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:39.178
That night he talked to Horse.

25
00:01:39.179 --> 00:01:42.454
"Henry said I'm real," Rabbit said.

26
00:01:42.455 --> 00:01:45.566
"But why can't I move?"

27
00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:50.041
Horse smiled. "You don't have to move.

28
00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:53.164
You're already real to Henry.

29
00:01:53.165 --> 00:01:58.616
You'll live forever in his mind."

30
00:01:58.617 --> 00:02:01.329
Rabbit thought about Horse's words.

31
00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.771
Horse was wise.

32
00:02:03.772 --> 00:02:08.995
But Rabbit wanted to be real like the outside rabbits.

33
00:02:08.996 --> 00:02:12.918
He wanted to hop and jump and play outside.

34
00:02:12.919 --> 00:02:15.247
Finally Rabbit shrugged.

35
00:02:15.248 --> 00:02:18.632
"I'm real to Henry," he thought.

36
00:02:18.633 --> 00:02:26.508
"So, I'll just try to be the best friend ever."

